<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 300" class="chart chart-histogram" role="img" aria-labelledby="dps-histogram-title dps-histogram-desc"><title id="dps-histogram-title">DPS per iteration, 1 fight</title><desc id="dps-histogram-desc">Histogram of the DPS of one fight in 1 bin (every fight has the same DPS), from 150.5 to 150.5 DPS. Mean 150.5 DPS, no confidence interval from one fight. The tallest bin has 1 fight.</desc><g class="chart-axes" font-size="11" fill="currentColor"><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="620" y2="252" class="chart-axis-line" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="28" x2="80" y2="252" class="chart-axis-line" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="80" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="80" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">149.5</text><line x1="215" y1="252" x2="215" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="215" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">150</text><line x1="350" y1="252" x2="350" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="350" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">150.5</text><line x1="485" y1="252" x2="485" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="485" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">151</text><line x1="620" y1="252" x2="620" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="620" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">151.5</text><line x1="75" y1="252" x2="80" y2="252" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="620" y2="252" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="252" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">0</text><line x1="75" y1="28" x2="80" y2="28" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="28" x2="620" y2="28" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="28" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">1</text><text x="350" y="278" class="chart-axis-title" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">DPS</text><text x="16" y="140" class="chart-axis-title" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 16 140)">Fights</text></g><g class="chart-bars"><rect class="chart-bar" x="282.5" y="28" width="135" height="224" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.55" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.9"><title>150.5–150.5 DPS: 1 fight</title></rect></g><g class="chart-mean-marker"><line x1="350" y1="28" x2="350" y2="252" class="chart-mean" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></line><text x="355" y="36" class="chart-mean-label" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" dominant-baseline="hanging">mean 150.5</text></g><g class="chart-legend" font-size="11" fill="currentColor"><line x1="80" y1="16" x2="98" y2="16" class="chart-mean" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></line><text x="103" y="16" dominant-baseline="middle">mean DPS</text></g></svg>
